## Shared settings for all three profiles

### Capacity

- **Max active sessions** — `30`
- **Max transcription streams** — `32`
- **Max unattached participants** — `120`
- **Max waiting sessions** — `60`
- **Storage reserve megabytes** — `256`

### Direct participation

- **Consents** — None
- **Enabled** — On
- **Participant information URL** — Leave blank
- **Participant information version** — Leave blank

### Privacy

- **Contract version** — `2`

### Progress

- **Planned sessions** — Leave blank

### Recruitment

- **Prolific › Completion paths › Completed** — Leave blank
- **Prolific › Completion paths › Game did not start** — Leave blank
- **Prolific › Completion paths › No consent** — Leave blank
- **Prolific › Completion paths › Participation ended early** — Leave blank
- **Prolific › Completion paths › Partner left** — Leave blank
- **Prolific › Completion paths › Technical failure** — Leave blank
- **Prolific › Enabled** — Off
- **Prolific › Study ID** — Leave blank

### Session

- **Reconnect grace seconds** — `15`
- **Session IDle timeout seconds** — `1800`
- **Session max lifetime seconds** — `14400`
- **Waiting session timeout seconds** — `600`

### Speechmatics

- **Enable partials** — On
- **End of utterance silence trigger** — `1.2`
- **Max delay** — `2.0`
- **Realtime URL** — `wss://eu.rt.speechmatics.com/v2`

### Transcription

- **Enabled** — Off
- **Language** — `en-US`
- **Model** — `enhanced`
- **Provider** — `speechmatics`

### Text-to-speech

